# DTC CIA ask + 2-year lookback

Whenever you **build** or **update** a patient segment, **ask before writing:**

> Should this patient audience also be limited to CIA Consumer Marketable Email?

Do not nest or skip CIA silently. Nest details: [CREATE.md](../../skill/d360-segments-activations/CREATE.md) CIA section.

Create/update with `lookbackPeriod: "P2Y"`. If the definition is not `P2Y`, update it before publish. See [PUBLISH.md](../../skill/d360-segments-activations/PUBLISH.md).

Does **not** apply to HCP segments. CIA is **not** part of a count.
